{"version":1,"content":"<p>天文學家對一顆質量高達木星11倍的巨型系外行星展開最新研究後發現，這個龐然大物的形成過程可能與傳統理論預測存在明顯差異。新發現不僅挑戰了長期以來關於巨型氣態行星誕生機制的認知，也讓科學家重新思考行星與「失敗恆星」之間的界限。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/science/1585980.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T15:40:29.464333+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":117,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T15:26:44+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T15:33:45.776820+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T15:33:45.776820+00:00","content_hash":"108726566dec764d27d57b082bbbd71c1f4376d17846de77ddd1c17a470d4ed4","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}